{
  "_note": "首页:只读「我的城市」与标准设置(不打网络);每个城市行自己带 depends 取数。\n`std` 给分段控件标选中态 —— 判法与 aq.df 同一份(std_actions)。页头时效锚不在这里读(见 home.xpage head 节点)。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "id": "saved",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "cities",
        "default": []
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n",
        "value": "$[length::(${saved})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c0",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c1",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c2",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},2)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c3",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},3)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c4",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},4)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c5",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},5)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c6",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},6)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c7",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},7)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障:上一步 index:: 落地的对象,紧邻节点读取可能晚一拍。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b2",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r1lat",
        "value": "${c0.lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r1lon",
        "value": "${c0.lon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r1n",
        "value": "${c0.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "只给存在的城市编码;空槽求出 null(`_nil` 从不赋值)→ 键不进输出,而不是一个空串。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r1q",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},1),urlEncode::(${c0.name}),${_nil})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r2lat",
        "value": "${c1.lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r2lon",
        "value": "${c1.lon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r2n",
        "value": "${c1.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r2q",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},2),urlEncode::(${c1.name}),${_nil})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r3lat",
        "value": "${c2.lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r3lon",
        "value": "${c2.lon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r3n",
        "value": "${c2.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r3q",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},3),urlEncode::(${c2.name}),${_nil})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r4lat",
        "value": "${c3.lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r4lon",
        "value": "${c3.lon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r4n",
        "value": "${c3.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r4q",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},4),urlEncode::(${c3.name}),${_nil})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r5lat",
        "value": "${c4.lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r5lon",
        "value": "${c4.lon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r5n",
        "value": "${c4.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r5q",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},5),urlEncode::(${c4.name}),${_nil})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r6lat",
        "value": "${c5.lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r6lon",
        "value": "${c5.lon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r6n",
        "value": "${c5.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r6q",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},6),urlEncode::(${c5.name}),${_nil})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r7lat",
        "value": "${c6.lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r7lon",
        "value": "${c6.lon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r7n",
        "value": "${c6.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r7q",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},7),urlEncode::(${c6.name}),${_nil})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r8lat",
        "value": "${c7.lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r8lon",
        "value": "${c7.lon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r8n",
        "value": "${c7.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r8q",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${n},8),urlEncode::(${c7.name}),${_nil})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sv",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "aqStd",
        "default": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_bs",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lang",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${@app.language},en)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "国内默认判据(doc/overseas-first.md §1,逐字照抄):地区 cn,或地区未知且界面中文 → 1。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,if::(eq::(${@app.region},overseas),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "std",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${sv},cn),cn,if::(eq::(${sv},us),us,if::(eq::(${cnd},1),cn,us)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "resultFilter",
      "params": {
        "keys": [
          "n",
          "r1lat",
          "r1lon",
          "r1n",
          "r1q",
          "r2lat",
          "r2lon",
          "r2n",
          "r2q",
          "r3lat",
          "r3lon",
          "r3n",
          "r3q",
          "r4lat",
          "r4lon",
          "r4n",
          "r4q",
          "r5lat",
          "r5lon",
          "r5n",
          "r5q",
          "r6lat",
          "r6lon",
          "r6n",
          "r6q",
          "r7lat",
          "r7lon",
          "r7n",
          "r7q",
          "r8lat",
          "r8lon",
          "r8n",
          "r8q",
          "std"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
